s that target what your visitors are bad at. Monsters & Traps: full stats and abili","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T07:10:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055884451","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4231210-1836506165568822","game_id":"steam-4231210","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Playtest Live Now!","summary":"The biggest update yet for the Inn Over Your Head is here! New adventurers to hunt, new ways to build, and the game now speaks 30+ more languages.Elite AdventurersEleven legendary adventurers now roam the land, and every one of them has heard about your tavern. Each elite comes with a unique portrait, voice lines, and their own party of allies. Kill them and claim a one-of-a-kind Trophy with a powerful passive effect (burning kobold monsters, crit-chance spike traps, regenerating dungeons, and m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T18:51:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568822","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4231210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4231210":"2026-10-26T01:49:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4231210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4757860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4231210","app_id":4231210,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:30Z","source